# Copy to .env. Every value is optional — with an empty .env the app runs on a
# dev-bypass login and a mock model, so it is fully clickable offline.

# ── Chat history ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SQLite file holding conversations and messages. Created on first write,
# together with its parent directory.
# SQLITE_PATH=data/chat.db

# ── Model ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The app calls OpenAI directly with a single fixed model. Without a key (or a
# base URL) it degrades to a canned mock stream rather than erroring.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Override the model. Defaults to gpt-5.6.
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.6

# Point at an OpenAI-compatible server instead of api.openai.com — LM Studio,
# vLLM, LiteLLM. Note the /v1 suffix. Set OPENAI_MODEL to whatever it serves.
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:1234/v1

# ── Auth ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required in production. Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
# AUTH_SECRET=


